  "notes": "NOTES\nCapo 4, G shapes, sounds in B. Anchor ring + pinky on 3rd fret B and e strings.\nG 320033, C2 x32033, G/B x20033, Em7 022033, Am7 x00033 (or x02010).\nGsus4 = 330033. One finger, A string 2nd to 3rd fret. Intro is that finger rocking.\nDsus4 = xx0233, D = xx0232. Pinky on and off.\nBoth sus chords land on \"Holy.\" Let them hang before resolving.\nZero barres in this song. Bass and one finger do all the work.\n\nNOTES\nCover is in D. Chart is G shapes capo 7 (tinny). Play D shapes, no capo.\nG→D xx0232, Gsus4→Dsus4 xx0233, Am7→Em7 022033, Em7→Bm7 x20202 or x24232,\nD→A x02220, Dsus4→Asus4 x02230, C2→G2 3x0233, G/B→D/F# 2x0232 thumb over.\nIntro is one finger rocking: D to Dsus4, pinky on and off. Let it drone.\nSus chords land on \"Holy.\" Hang before resolving.\nBm7 is the only barre and it's held. Full grip x24232.\nMiddle option if you want brighter: capo 2, C shapes, also sounds in D."
